{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sypnosis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Happened Here </strong>is a short adventure horror game: around <i>30-45 minutes</i>, exploring the classic horror trope of being locked inside a house and exploring it in order to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play as Elly, a 20 years old girl coming back from work one day to find her home completely changed and her roommates nowhere in sight!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you assist her to go out, and will you find the truth?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics made with limited 2bit palette, inspired by classic Nintendo games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that adds to the mysterious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 compelling characters, including our main character Elly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large mystery to solve involving the characters and the mansion itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main puzzles which put your brain in the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main endings and 3 bad endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets to find if you look deep enough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret room in classic RPG maker games fashion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Thank you for giving me a chance for happiness, and thank you for playing.&quot;</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ends before it starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Leave this space.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Sister, can you hear me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, where are you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"I'll save you, sister","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Endlessly Looping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Secret note","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"See you in full colours.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Cleaning queen!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"},{"name":"Together forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866320/05811cc7dfbbb51293e3df1de40dd4b4328c0802.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866320?t=1753269947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866320?t=1753269947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866320/8b8fd70859ae024200e5d19083e28ac165e204db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753269947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866320/8b8fd70859ae024200e5d19083e28ac165e204db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753269947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has included but not limited to: mild jumpscares, glitches, spooky giggles, flashing lights, ghosts and demons."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sypnosis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Happened Here </strong>is a short adventure horror game: around <i>30-45 minutes</i>, exploring the classic horror trope of being locked inside a house and exploring it in order to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play as Elly, a 20 years old girl coming back from work one day to find her home completely changed and her roommates nowhere in sight!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you assist her to go out, and will you find the truth?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics made with limited 2bit palette, inspired by classic Nintendo games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that adds to the mysterious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 compelling characters, including our main character Elly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large mystery to solve involving the characters and the mansion itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main puzzles which put your brain in the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main endings and 3 bad endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets to find if you look deep enough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret room in classic RPG maker games fashion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Thank you for giving me a chance for happiness, and thank you for playing.&qu